      "comment": "Furiosa: Koshchei and the Perfect Tree",
      "content": "Under the name Doctor Moreau, the bio-alchemist Koshchei treated the villagers of Okurov. After Furiosa's alteration succeeded, he planned to turn them into a collective consciousness he called the Perfect Tree, a life beyond time. Villagers would become Leshy, then blue algae, shedding their form. Furiosa was meant to join, but refused.",
