      "comment": "Furiosa: Furiosa and Nastya",
      "content": "Nastya, a young child of Okurov, calls Furiosa her idol. After the Traveler's chance meeting, Nastya returns home with a stolen key. Furiosa asks the Traveler why they did not take Nastya away, fights, and wishes Nastya no regret. Nastya wonders why Furiosa has not become the Perfect Tree.",
