      ],
      "comment": "Furiosa: Furiosa the Local Legend",
      "content": "Outside the quest, the Furiosa fight is a Local Legend near the Scars of Cursed Obsession domain on the Everfrozen Earth. In-game she is described as a Volkodlak archer whose alchemical modification pushed her body beyond the limits of living things, left her with some authority over trees and a bearing as if parasitized by them. This entry is a game encounter that mirrors her story.",
